  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">URU/23/005 Systemic engagement for inclusive public sphere</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">This initiative will focus on strengthening systemic engagement between the Parliament and civil society for a more inclusive public sphere, particularly considering the incorporation of systematically excluded groups such as women and youth. The process will be driven by the principles and mechanisms of the deliberative democracy approach. It will pursue three interconnected dimensions to advance systemic engagement between the National Parliament and civil society, focused on women and youth p</narrative>
  </description>
